WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.861
Bua ngi SaloneHCM kɛɛ H R officer lesin hu.

2
00:00:02.861 --> 00:00:10.270
I wɔ̃kɔ nyandehũ kɛtɛi kpɛlɛ ngi lɔ ma ti yɛlɛi hu — ti yɛlɛi kpɛlɛi nɔ payroll, compliance, ti audit hiɛi ngi vuli lenga.

3
00:00:10.270 --> 00:00:15.250
Mu nɛ́ wɔti employee register, leave management, attendance, ti document vault ma.

4
00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:18.927
Employee register nɔ i yila ngi gbi gɔlɔ hu.

5
00:00:18.927 --> 00:00:24.097
Ngɛlɛ kpɛlɛi bi grade, salary, bank details, NASSIT number, ti department lɔ yaa kɛi.

6
00:00:24.097 --> 00:00:35.594
Search bar nɔ lɔ i nyande huɔ̃ wo gboyɛmɔ ti lɛ, ti add employee button nɔ lɔ i nyande wɔni ngiɛɛ puui ti lɛ — form i ngi kɔtɔ field kpɛlɛi nyande hu nɔ bi lɔ ma, statutory identifiers kua.

7
00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:43.064
Kɛ gbi, leave. Employeei nyɛ́ leave bi self-service portal hu, ti nɔ request yɛi nya yaa i gɔlɔ ngi pɛlɛ-wɔ gɔ.

8
00:00:43.064 --> 00:00:50.554
I ngi lɔ balances, dates nɛ́ bi puunɔ ti team calendar kpɛlɛ lo i wɔti pɛlɛ-wɔ leke ngi ji — kɛlɛ cover gaps ji i yɛngama.

9
00:00:52.250 --> 00:01:00.043
Attendance nɛ́ i lɔ kpindi kɛɛi ngi yaa kpɛlɛ: nyɛi nya clock in nga, nyɛi tɔ, ti timesheet totals nɛ́ payroll kɛɛ nya pie hu kɛɛi.

10
00:01:00.043 --> 00:01:06.290
H R ngi lɔ records kpɛɛkpɛ a nyande ti leke device ji i wɔɔ — ti kpɛɛkpɛ kpɛlɛi nya audit log kɛɛ kɛtɛlɔ.

11
00:01:07.250 --> 00:01:16.665
Kɛ wulo, document vault. Contracts, identity documents, disciplinary letters — upload ngiapu ti lɛ, cloud kɛɛ store ti wama lɔ, ti i organisationi nɔ ngi ma lɔ.

12
00:01:16.665 --> 00:01:21.314
Search ti category filters lɔ i nyande huvei kpɛlɛi ngi lenga sekɔnd wɔlui kɛɛ.

13
00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:27.793
Kumbui: employee data kpɛlɛi bi hinda nɛ́ payroll disputei ngi kɔngɔ lei.

14
00:01:27.793 --> 00:01:33.954
I ti leke ngi hũmɔ a lenga, H R officer quiz nɔ Training Center kɛɛ nyande ti i certificate ngi lo.
